## SECTION 1 SYNTHESIS

**Layer 1 — The Model:** Productize (1.2) + Price (1.3) = repeatable unit.
**Layer 2 — The Measurement Stack:** Tracker (1.7) → P&L (1.5/1.6) → LTGP:CAC (1.8) = cascading visibility.
**Layer 3 — The Decision Engine:** Theory of Constraints (1.4) + P&L Decisions (1.6) = monthly optimization loop.
**The Sequencer (1.1):** Tells you which layer to focus on at each revenue stage.
**One sentence:** Productize → Price → Track → Find constraint → Fix → Volume up → Repeat.

